{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL0hpbG1hJTIwJTI4MjAyMiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Hilma","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1DG8gAw3ghKy1QhM7O55wbD7XDI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eQvKX69XMRNNgQuwwBL4Wy1qC8h.jpg","description":"Hilma af Klint (1862-1944) is an important part of art history and one of the first ever painters of abstract art. However, unlike the work of many of her peers at the time hers was misunderstood and neglected  until long after her death. This is a story about Hilma and the circumstances which made her paintings possible. The film picks up during her early life and ends today; when her art connects with people of all religions and cultures. Just as she intended.","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Drama","History","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.2","runtime":"120 min","cast":["Lena Olin","Tora Hallström","Lily Cole","Tom Wlaschiha","Emmi Tjernström","Catherine Chalk","Rebecca Calder","Maeve Dermody"],"director":["Lasse Hallström"],"released":"2022-10-19T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Lena Olin","character":"Hilma af Klint","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tUg7cH4qLqs5WdOIH0WMQby9kWH.jpg"},{"name":"Tora Hallström","character":"Young Hilma","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rAG7gtnmDOscUxXGN0suJpMFbnY.jpg"},{"name":"Lily Cole","character":"Mathilda","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3FMhejoBwtmfkkoS9vgJAxYa7fy.jpg"},{"name":"Tom Wlaschiha","character":"Rudolf Steiner","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3Qbdm6f7AFAImiRU1TTwQ5AtHMQ.jpg"},{"name":"Emmi Tjernström","character":"Hermina","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6nCNO5dRBjq605QuVERpYcaSPSi.jpg"},{"name":"Catherine Chalk","character":"Anna Cassel"},{"name":"Rebecca Calder","character":"Cornelia","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2pkBR7d9MMrgRUBopEc7kRP8ZJL.jpg"},{"name":"Maeve Dermody","character":"Sigrid","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bbpRTgz7O2